: "1 teaspoon: fingertip (tip to 1 st joint)\nPlanning meals that fit your health needs, tastes, budget, and schedule can be complicated. Ask your doctor to refer you to diabetes self-management education and support (DSMES) services. Through DSMES, you'll work with a diabetes educator to create a healthy meal plan just for you. You can also visit the Find a Diabetes Education Program in Your Area locator for DSMES services near you.\nWhy a meal plan is important", `title`: "Lập kế hoạch bữa ăn cho người tiểu đường — nguồn web tự động", `topic`: "Lập kế hoạch bữa ăn cho người tiểu đường", `url`: "https://www.cdc.gov/diabetes/healthy-eating/diabetes-meal-planning.html", `web_source_id`: "cdc-meal-planning"};
